  "reviewPacketIntro": "The questions below are the app's scholarly review register: the 18-question checklist and the 8 pass-2 unresolved items. They are asked of qualified Maliki scholars — priority to Mauritanian scholars familiar with the living Maliki tradition of the region, then to qualified Maliki scholars from other historically Maliki regions. Each item states why it matters and the current evidence status. Nothing in this document is a fatwa, and nothing in it may be cited as scholarly approval.",
