  "reviewP1Question": "Extract and verify al-Dasuqi's glosses on الفجر الصادق / غروب حمرة الشفق / «وعلى جماعة آخره» in Hashiyat al-Dasuqi 'ala al-Sharh al-Kabir.",
  "@reviewP1Question": {
    "description": "D7 review item P1: review question"
  },
  "reviewP1Why": "Dasuqi is the standard gloss on Dardir; his wording would settle or sharpen the fajr/shafaq definitions.",
  "@reviewP1Why": {
