  "reviewP2Question": "Read the prayer-times chapter of al-Kafi fi Fiqh Ahl al-Madinah (Ibn 'Abd al-Barr) in the primary text.",
  "@reviewP2Question": {
    "description": "D7 review item P2: review question"
